HISTORY ii130101r_08101043431_raw.fits                                          HISTORY ii131a01r_08074153434_raw.fits                                          COMMENT = 'Reference file created by J. Mack'                                   HISTORY   flat098mi_pfl.fits renamed to sca2025ti_pfl.fits on Dec 10 2008       HISTORY   November 19, 2010: This new IR flatfield is a combination of the      HISTORY   existing ground-based flatfield and a new low-frequency correction    HISTORY    (L-flat) derived from a large number (>2000) of long exposure (>300s)HISTORY   science images that have been combined after masking out objects,     HISTORY   effectively equating the L-flat with a high S/N sky image. A modest   HISTORY   smoothing has been applied to the L-flat. The L-flat does not show a  HISTORY   significant wave-length dependence, therefore a single L-flat has beenHISTORY   applied to all filters.                                               HISTORY   The sky image was created using calwf3 version 2.1 (15-May-2010).     HISTORY   flat_f098m_pfl.fits renamed to uc72113ni_pfl.fits on Dec 7 2010       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   ----------------                                                      HISTORY   October 01, 2020: These new D-flats correct for IR 'blobs', small     HISTORY   regions with reduced sensitivity in calibrated images. These flats    HISTORY   were derived by stacking inflight observations of sparse fields (with HISTORY   sources masked) after each blob appearance date, thus illuminating theHISTORY   detector with a deep, combined image of the sky background. These     HISTORY   flats are intended to be used in combination with new P-flats derived HISTORY   by Mack et al. (2020) which improve the 'pixel-to-pixel' sensitivity  HISTORY   calibration with wavelength. During the flat fielding step, calwf3    HISTORY   will correct each image by the product of the P-flat and the D-flat   HISTORY   reference files.                                                      HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY   Blob 'delta' flats are available in six filters (F098M, F105W, F110W, HISTORY   F125W, F140W, F160W) for 49 unique blob appearance 'events' and       HISTORY   correct for 148 strong and weak blobs appearing through July 10, 2018 HISTORY   with errors <1%.                                                      HISTORY   ---------------                                                       HISTORY F098M_49_dfl.fits renamed to 4ac1829li_dfl.fits on Oct 12 2020                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          